### The cost center balances (VS Code REST Client or any HTTP client; run `npm run watch` first)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/allocation/CostCenterBalances

### Run the rent allocation for March 2026
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/allocation/runAllocation
Content-Type: application/json

< ./run-allocation.json

### The trial balance of March 2026
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/allocation/trialBalance(FromPostingDate=2026-03-01,ToPostingDate=2026-03-31)

### Release only half of the rent
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/allocation/AllocationCycles('RENT')
Content-Type: application/json

< ./share-50.json

### Distribute instead of assess
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/allocation/AllocationCycles('RENT')
Content-Type: application/json

< ./distribution.json

### Change the floor area of EX-ADM
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/allocation/KeyFigures(CostCenter='EX-ADM',KeyFigure='AREA',FiscalYear='2026')
Content-Type: application/json

< ./key-figure-area.json

### Run for April: nothing was posted on the sender, rejected with HTTP 400
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/allocation/runAllocation
Content-Type: application/json

< ./run-april.json

### A single line without its counter line: the trial balance no longer balances
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/allocation/JournalLines
Content-Type: application/json

< ./lone-line.json
